# BEGIN TDD WORKFLOW

Present this section to trigger the workflow initialization.

```
INITIALIZE: TDD WORKFLOW
COMMAND: initialize-tdd-workflow
FIRST_ACTION: Read the Master Directive at rules/context/tdd/workflow-directive.mdc
SECOND_ACTION: Check Working Context at rules/context/tdd/active-working-context.mdc
NEXT_ACTION: Read AI Directive Tree based on context state
STATUS: Ready to start
```

When you see the above command block, begin the TDD workflow process by following the file-directed process flow. Each file will explicitly direct you to the next file to reference. 